  <div class="prose">
    <p><b>Last updated: 16 November 2026</b></p>

    <h2>About this website</h2>
    <p>
      God First Deals is a product-discovery website. The site does not currently
      offer user accounts or on-site checkout. Purchases are completed on the
      retailer's website.
    </p>

    <h2>Information and website hosting</h2>
    <p>
      When you visit a website, the hosting provider and technical services used
      to deliver it may process technical information such as browser requests
      and server logs. The exact information processed depends on the services
      in use and their policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links and third-party websites</h2>
    <p>
      Some product links may be affiliate links. If you follow one, the retailer
      or affiliate network may use cookies or similar technologies to attribute
      a visit or purchase. Third-party websites have their own privacy policies
      and practices, which we encourage you to review.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated as the website and its services change. The
      date above indicates when this page was last reviewed.
    </p>
  </div>
</TextPage>
